00:16:27,220 --> 00:16:28,740
and a loose cannon.

265
00:16:29,280 --> 00:16:30,060
I'm sorry!

266
00:16:32,580 --> 00:16:34,140
That Takata fella...

267
00:16:34,140 --> 00:16:35,520
He seems so mild-mannered,

268
00:16:35,640 --> 00:16:37,280
but maybe he's actually terrifying.

269
00:16:37,680 --> 00:16:38,740
I better be careful.

270
00:16:40,620 --> 00:16:41,660
I'm not here,

271
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:44,380
because I think this will help me more than our practice will.

272
00:16:45,500 --> 00:16:46,220
It's just...

273
00:16:46,780 --> 00:16:48,680
This camp has so many strong players.

274
00:16:49,220 --> 00:16:50,400
I want to be a part of it.

275
00:16:51,040 --> 00:16:54,140
I want to see what these great players are like outside of matches.

276
00:16:54,800 --> 00:16:56,720
And to see what makes them so strong.

277
00:16:57,880 --> 00:16:59,100
I have to know!

278
00:17:01,900 --> 00:17:05,180
I do understand that you're feeling very restless right now.

279
00:17:05,540 --> 00:17:07,420
However, that doesn't excuse your actions.

280
00:17:07,800 --> 00:17:09,840
You're causing problems for the camp organizers.

281
00:17:10,260 --> 00:17:10,800
You need...

282
00:17:10,800 --> 00:17:13,480
So, we have another ball boy around for the time being.

283
00:17:13,740 --> 00:17:14,760
We can handle it.

284
00:17:14,760 --> 00:17:15,260
Hm?

285
00:17:15,260 --> 00:17:27,220
I made it!

286
00:17:27,220 --> 00:17:31,140
Karasuno High School Volleyball Club.

287
00:17:31,140 --> 00:17:34,760
That's the team that beat Ushuaka.

288
00:17:34,760 --> 00:17:37,660
The Itachiyama Institute.

289
00:17:38,780 --> 00:17:39,920
Giyomi Sakusa.

290
00:17:41,040 --> 00:17:43,440
One of the top three Spikers in Japan.

291
00:17:43,820 --> 00:17:45,680
And the only second year of the three.

292
00:17:46,520 --> 00:17:49,240
And I get to watch him up close.

293
00:17:49,240 --> 00:17:51,400
My name's Tobio Kageyama.

294
00:17:51,520 --> 00:17:52,460
First year of Karasuno.

295
00:17:52,780 --> 00:17:53,420
I'm a setter.

296
00:17:53,860 --> 00:17:55,280
It's very nice to meet you.

297
00:17:56,120 --> 00:17:56,540
Huh?

298
00:17:56,920 --> 00:17:58,040
Yeah, sure.

299
00:17:58,040 --> 00:18:02,600
Oh, man.

300
00:18:03,040 --> 00:18:04,440
I'm getting so excited.

301
00:18:06,700 --> 00:18:07,900
He wasn't even invited.

302
00:18:08,120 --> 00:18:09,340
Is he crazy or what?

303
00:18:09,340 --> 00:18:12,220
For a second there, I thought he was a middle school kid.

304
00:18:12,660 --> 00:18:14,680
He sure looks like one without his jacket on.

305
00:18:15,240 --> 00:18:18,000
Now that I've seen him in person, he's even smaller than I thought.

306
00:18:18,160 --> 00:18:18,780
What the hell?

307
00:18:19,720 --> 00:18:22,320
Fine, let the little shrimp from Karasuno stick around.

308
00:18:22,400 --> 00:18:23,440
It's not like I care.

309
00:18:23,820 --> 00:18:25,360
I'm gonna grind him to a pulp.

310
00:18:26,220 --> 00:18:29,540
Ione-approved players are just not like the rest of us, are they?

311
00:18:30,760 --> 00:18:33,820
To be honest, I had recommended Hinata for this camp.

312
00:18:34,460 --> 00:18:34,860
Yes.

313
00:18:35,260 --> 00:18:37,720
So if you don't mind letting him stay...

314
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:37,920
Right.

315
00:18:38,280 --> 00:18:38,580
Yes.

316
00:18:38,580 --> 00:18:39,300
Okay.

317
00:18:40,100 --> 00:18:40,820
Thank you very much.

318
00:18:40,900 --> 00:18:41,340
Talk to you.

319
00:18:47,820 --> 00:18:49,180
Do you think he'll be okay?

320
00:18:49,420 --> 00:18:53,000
If Coach Washijo didn't want him there, he would have made that clear to everyone.

321
00:18:56,580 --> 00:19:00,740
Looking at this roster, Washijo is definitely in charge of this thing.

322
00:19:01,820 --> 00:19:04,220
Doesn't look to me like the old man has changed a bit.

323
00:19:05,400 --> 00:19:06,440
Simple is best.

324
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:08,180
He loves height and power.

325
00:19:08,580 --> 00:19:12,840
And he's always got his feelers out, looking for strong players to recruit.

326
00:19:15,900 --> 00:19:19,180
I don't know how far Hinata has thought this through, but...

327
00:19:19,180 --> 00:19:24,300
This could be a really important opportunity for the kid, still.

328
00:19:26,500 --> 00:19:26,900
Well...

329
00:19:26,900 --> 00:19:28,220
I mean, personally, I couldn't have asked for anything better.

330
00:19:28,220 --> 00:19:29,340
I mean, personally, I couldn't have asked for anything better.

331
00:19:29,340 --> 00:19:31,840
Let me just say this.

332
00:19:31,840 --> 00:19:38,160
Without the play of your personal setter, Kageyama, I don't see you as being worth anything.

333
00:19:38,160 --> 00:19:52,880
If you don't like being a ball boy, you're welcome to go home at any time.

334
00:19:52,880 --> 00:19:59,480
This might be far more grueling for Hinata than he realizes.

335
00:19:59,480 --> 00:20:06,800
The floor's not hardwood.

336
00:20:06,800 --> 00:20:08,400
See that screen?

337
00:20:08,400 --> 00:20:24,740
It's constantly showing footage from down here on the courts with a six-second delay.

338
00:20:24,740 --> 00:20:29,000
That way, you can examine all of your plays in detail.

339
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:30,000
That's awesome!

340
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:31,000
Gather round.

341
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:40,240
Now then, this is our men's Olympic team coach.

342
00:20:40,240 --> 00:20:41,760
His name is Hiberita.

343
00:20:41,760 --> 00:20:43,260
Would you mind giving the boys a pep talk?

344
00:20:43,260 --> 00:20:44,260
Oh, sure.

345
00:20:44,260 --> 00:20:50,140
Well, I'm sure you're all pretty tired of hearing us old guys, so I'll keep it short.

346
00:20:50,140 --> 00:20:56,420
I'm sure you've all heard, Japan crumbles before height and power.

347
00:20:56,420 --> 00:20:59,520
That was the old saying, but it's outdated now.

348
00:20:59,520 --> 00:21:03,080
The qualities you have aren't things you show off on the outside.

349
00:21:03,080 --> 00:21:05,760
They're things you bring out from the inside.

350
00:21:05,760 --> 00:21:09,560
When you're up against the world, give them a good fight.

351
00:21:09,560 --> 00:21:29,880
So let's prove to everyone there's more to volleyball than the eye test.

352
00:21:29,880 --> 00:21:33,560
Gather up, everyone!

353
00:21:33,560 --> 00:21:42,560
I'm very sorry for interrupting practice.

354
